# Copy to .env (gitignored). Read by tool/fetch_models.sh, never passed to builds.
#
# HF_TOKEN: a Hugging Face read token for the gated EmbeddingGemma
# (litert-community/embeddinggemma-300m), which tool/fetch_models.sh fetches
# into assets/models/ with the other built-in models (they are not in git).
# Accept the Gemma terms on that repo's page with the same account first.
# The app itself needs no token at run time.
HF_TOKEN=
#
# VOICE_GATE_DBFS (a stricter silence gate for a loud venue, dBFS, default -45)
# goes through the environment instead:
#   VOICE_GATE_DBFS=-40 tool/run_macos.sh
#
# If a secret is ever needed in the app, pass it with --dart-define-from-file=.env
# and remember that it ends up in the binary.
